(optional/102A) Next

A next is found in loops where we want to skip certain cases
if could substitute


results &lt;- c()

for (i in 1:100) {
  value &lt;- sample(-5:5, 1)

  if (value &lt;= 0) {
    next   # skip invalid values
  }

  results &lt;- c(results, value)
}

